        <headline>Beach Hazards Statement issued September 26 at 3:36PM EDT until September 28 at 4:00AM EDT by NWS Buffalo NY</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Strong currents and dangerous swimming conditions
expected.

* WHERE...Beaches of Orleans, Monroe, Wayne, Northern Cayuga,
and Oswego counties.

* WHEN...From 11 PM EDT this evening through late Sunday night.

* IMPACTS...Strong currents and dangerous swimming conditions.
</description>
        <instruction>Stay out of the water to avoid dangerous swimming conditions.</instruction>
